// title: List the triggered ASR events for each device in a pivot table · Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceEvents
// purpose: This query returns a row for each device with a count for each Attack Surface Reduction trigger type. This can be used to find devices that trigger a lot of ASR rules. The reference can be used to find more information on each specific ASR rule.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Endpoint/ASR%20Rules/Pivot%20-%20ASRTriggers.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
// license: BSD-3-Clause (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
DeviceEvents
| where ActionType startswith 'ASR'
| project DeviceName, ActionType
| evaluate pivot(ActionType)
